<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Seksyen 8 Akta ibu dipinda—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1a) Upon receiving a report under subsection (1), the Court shall cause the offender to be brought before it and the Court may issue— (a) a summon requiring the offender to appear at the place and time as specified in the summons; or (b) a warrant for his arrest. (1b) An offender when arrested under paragraph (2)(b) may, if not brought immediately before the Court under subsection (2)— (a) be detained in a place of detention until such time as he can be brought before the Court; or (b) be released on bail, with or without sureties.”; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
