<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@/~cl_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “On receipt of such report the Court shall cause the offender to be brought before it, and if satisfied as to the truth of such allegations, may pass” dengan perkataan “If the Court is satisfied that such allegation is true, the Court may pass”."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/16/msa@> .
